  "description": "The proposal is a single-storey glazed rear extension (conservatory) at 37 Peaketon Avenue. It projects a further 3.0 m beyond the existing 3.0 m single-storey rear extension and matches its width (approx. 8.9 m). Maximum height is 2.9 m above natural ground level. The lightweight, predominantly glazed structure is modest in scale, subordinate to the host dwelling, and not visible from the street. Its height and transparent construction keep its effect on neighbouring outlook and daylight to a minimum. There is no impact on the front elevation or the character of the street.",
